# No OneDrive

StickLLM work lives on the local disk. OneDrive is too slow and must not be used for this project.

## Use

- Worktree: `C:\Users\peter\stickllm-vault-wt`
- Main git repo: `C:\Users\peter\stickllm`
- ISO output: `C:\Users\peter\stickllm-vault-wt\out\`

## Do not

- Do not clone, build, copy models, write ISOs, or flash from `C:\Users\peter\OneDrive\...`
- Do not bind-mount an OneDrive path into Docker
- Do not point scripts, flash paths, or the editor workspace back at OneDrive

If a path contains `OneDrive`, stop and switch to the local disk before continuing.
